The assert statement corresponds to the comment that starts with "@@@". The value of `y` needs to be accessed using `OLD(y)` and added to `x` to check if their values are equal before the program proceeds. The return value of the function can be used with `RET`, since in the case of the ArrayList class, the return value is `_size`, not `x`. Thus, the statement should be as follows:

